"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemData"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemData"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents16OUDSListItemDataV","title":"OUDSListItemData","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemdata"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the main content displayed within a list item component such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a mandatory label (an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or a custom ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and optional"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description, overline, extra label and helper text. Every textual field accepts a raw ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a localized string or an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"text":" through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", plus optional slots.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (string literal is implicitly converted to .textual(.raw))","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\"))","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\", isBold: true))","","    \/\/ Localized label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(.localized(\"label.key\")))","","    \/\/ Styled rich label (user-controlled font, color, markdown…)","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: .textual(.rich(AttributedString.from(text: \"Label\",","                                                        foregroundColor: .orange,","                                                        font: .headline)))","    )","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content (string literals auto-convert to .raw OUDSTextualContent)","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Mixed raw \/ rich text per field — any textual field can be styled","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        description: .rich(myStyledDescription),","        overline: \"Plain overline\",","        helperText: .rich(myStyledHelper)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Custom view label","anchor":"Custom-view-label"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing a custom view as label:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bold styling is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must provide an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Small size behavior","anchor":"Small-size-behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".oudsListItemSize(.small)"},{"text":" modifier),","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"overline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"extraLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties are ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}]},{"text":" to ensure a compact layout.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Only the ","type":"text"},{"code":"label","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bottomSlot"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"automatically hidden","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textSlot"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .oudsListItemSize(.small)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSListItemData/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","title":"init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a new list item data model with a text label."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"label","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hasBoldLabel","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"description","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"overline","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extraLabel","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preci